5
00:00:05,789 --> 00:00:07,242
Satu-satunya di dunia.

6
00:00:07,262 --> 00:00:09,571
Namanya Dahala Khagrabari,

7
00:00:09,591 --> 00:00:11,646
kebun seluas kira-kira satu

8
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:12,807
lapangan sepak bola di

9
00:00:12,827 --> 00:00:13,828
perbatasan India dan

10
00:00:13,848 --> 00:00:15,036
Bangladesh.

11
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:16,259
Petak wilayah yang terkurung

12
00:00:16,279 --> 00:00:17,311
